;
; How a fee-checked payment is filed in the M global ^ZXFEE, in MYRA. The
; app asks whether a payment's numbers fit the record before it files it.
^ZXFEE(batch:i9, seq:i9) = amount:n15.2! ^ fee:n9.2! ^ from:i10! ^ to:i10!
